  "prospect": {
    "case": {
      "value": "As the bulls (Freedom Capital's August upgrade, Seeking Alpha's 'underfollowed grid hardware winner' thesis) frame it, PLPC is a small-cap beneficiary of a multi-year, ~$1.4 trillion utility transmission-and-distribution capex cycle, riding record USA energy-market demand for line hardware.",
