      "as_of": "2026-09-07"
    },
    "depends_on": {
      "value": "Continued double-digit growth in USA energy-market sales (Q2 2026 USA sales +32% y/y) and gross margin holding near the 34% record set in Q2 2026 as utility grid capex scales.",
      "source": "https://www.stocktitan.net/news/PLPC/preformed-line-products-announces-record-second-quarter-2026-9zu693uf3ae8.html",
      "as_of": "2026-07-29"
