    "bear_case": {
      "value": "Analyst coverage is just two names and the only posted price target ($275, set in March 2026 before the Q2 beat) implies roughly 31% downside from the current price; the stock is already up over 100% in a year and pulled back 13.5% in the past month, suggesting much of the grid-buildout story is priced in.",
